@startuml F3.7-ERRO-sem-tcc-supervise
title F3.7-ERRO — 403 sem tcc.supervise
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TccController" as Ctrl

Prof -> WebApp: /tccs?to=me
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /tccs?to=me
note right of Jwt
  tcc.supervise ausente
  TccController não executa
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403
WebApp --> Prof: acesso negado

@enduml
